From: Martin Kibera <martin.kibera.n@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 12:31:30 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] fix 0 views bug on /channel endpoint

issue presents on collab videos. fix adds additional query against /search
---
